sequenceDiagram
 actor U as Run owner
 participant A as Public API
 participant P as Live policy
 participant D as Run store
 U->>A: Start/resume flow,locale,ownership proof
 A->>P: Authorize principal/project/action
 P-->>A: allow or deny
 alt Allowed
  A->>D: Create pinned manifest or load authorized run
  D-->>A: release,input revision,active state
  A-->>U: Next applicable question + acknowledged save
 else Denied/expired
  A-->>U: Safe denial/recovery route
 end
